{
  "id": "04006_ryakusu",
  "headword": "{略|りゃく}す",
  "reading": "りゃくす",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (godan)",
  "gloss": "to abbreviate; to omit",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to abbreviate; to shorten",
      "explanation": "To reduce a word, phrase, or text to a shorter form."
    },
    {
      "sense_number": 2,
      "gloss": "to omit; to leave out",
      "explanation": "To skip or leave out parts of something, especially in explanations or presentations."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "04006_ryakusu_ex1",
      "japanese": "「{国際連合|こくさいれんごう}」を「{国連|こくれん}」と{略|りゃく}す。",
      "english": "To abbreviate 'United Nations' to 'UN'.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "04006_ryakusu_ex2",
      "japanese": "{説明|せつめい}を{略|りゃく}して{結論|けつろん}に{移|うつ}ります。",
      "english": "I'll skip the explanation and move to the conclusion.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "04006_ryakusu_ex3",
      "japanese": "{以下|いか}、{略|りゃく}。",
      "english": "The rest is omitted.",
      "notes": "Common in formal writing",
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "04006_ryakusu_ex4",
      "japanese": "「スマートフォン」を「スマホ」と{略|りゃく}すことが{多|おお}い。",
      "english": "'Smartphone' is often abbreviated to 'sumaho'.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "04006_ryakusu_ex5",
      "japanese": "{時間|じかん}がないので、{途中|とちゅう}の{手順|てじゅん}を{略|りゃく}して{進|すす}めよう。",
      "english": "Since we don't have time, let's skip the intermediate steps and move forward.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "04006_ryakusu_ex6",
      "japanese": "「{東京大学|とうきょうだいがく}」を「{東大|とうだい}」と{略|りゃく}すのは{日本人|にほんじん}なら{誰|だれ}でも{知|し}っている。",
      "english": "Everyone in Japan knows that 'Tokyo University' is abbreviated to 'Todai'.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive). Pattern: Xを{略|りゃく}す.\n\nALTERNATE FORM: {略|りゃく}する (する-verb form) is also common.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n・{以下|いか}{略|りゃく} (the rest is omitted)\n・{中|なか}{略|りゃく} (middle portion omitted)\n・{前|まえ}{略|りゃく} (opening omitted - in letters)\n・{後|あと}{略|りゃく} (remainder omitted)\n\nRELATED:\n・{略語|りゃくご} (abbreviation)\n・{略称|りゃくしょう} (abbreviated name)\n・{省略|しょうりゃく} (omission, abbreviation)",
